      you encountered any bugs, or have any kind of feedback, please let us know
      on

      <link="https://github.com/BoundfoxStudios/fairy-tale-defender/issues"><color="lightblue">GitHub</color>
      <size=150%><sprite name="GitHub"></size></link> or <link="https://discord.gg/tHqNzMT"><color="lightblue">Discord
      </color><size=150%><sprite name="Discord"></size></link>


      We appreciate
      it very much.'
